{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的感受提示不如X细致地贴合音乐进程，尤其缺少随乐句分时出现的微妙变化，部分情绪层次被压缩了。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左侧叙事更连贯，人物的念头、顾虑、行动和情绪变化形成了清楚的因果链，右侧感受词又能作为补充，不必频繁在叙事和感受之间切换，因此更容易抓住每段要点，也更容易理解前后为什么这样发展。X的关键词高亮和分时感受确实更利于扫读，也更能捕捉音乐中的细微起伏，但感受信息有时过密、相近意象反复出现，反而容易分散注意力。综合普通观众边听边看的体验，我更愿意选Y，但它在音乐细节的呈现上确实牺牲了一些东西。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "be6f0f38-18e2-43d4-a12e-0aba03db71a3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T205532469392Z", "elapsed_seconds": 151.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T20:58:03.684676+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bed9b1615b90c758c2a7f8b32061746fd0ace47a6bac89aed38564d35e97ea09", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat